# ADR-021 Phase 2 (FR8): pins the Next/SWC build target to the effective
# runtime floor Phase 0 established for the native Android WebView —
# System WebView >= ~Chrome 67 (independent of `minSdk`; below Chrome 67,
# zod v4's BigInt usage and Capacitor 8's bridge don't run at all).
#
# This is a repo-wide browserslist config (Next reads it for every build,
# web/desktop included), but Chrome 67 is comfortably older than any browser
# web/desktop realistically ships to, so pinning it here is a no-op widening
# for those targets and only matters for the native export's transpile
# target (see FR8, `frontend/scripts/build-native-static.mjs`).
Chrome >= 67
